From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A7om <hatter6822@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hw/misc/bcm2835_property: Answer each tag in a function of
 its own

Move the switch that answers one tag out of the loop that walks the
request, into a function that returns the response length. The
framebuffer tags change the configuration through a pointer to the
copy the loop keeps.

No functional change.
---
 hw/misc/bcm2835_property.c | 813 +++++++++++++++++++------------------
 1 file changed, 416 insertions(+), 397 deletions(-)

